{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_invitation

    The invitation of a family that is an ambassador of the centre, as another family opens it: a card from them, on
    the wall of the centre, a little crooked and stuck with two strips of tape, with the emblem of the centre on its
    band, who invites written by hand («La familia de Leo» les invita) and what to (Vengan a conocer el Colegio Los
    Arces); the welcome of the centre under it; the next open acts as visits to come, each with its weekday in small
    capitals, its date in big, its hours and place, and its button to sign up; and asking for information, in one
    quiet line. Nothing of the family that invites beyond how it signs. The seal of Eguahe goes at the foot, in the
    frame of the page. The same card is the one the family sees on its own page.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "kicker": "La familia de Leo les invita",
        "card": {"logo": "", "initials": "CA", "from": "<span class=\"invitacion-firma\">La familia de Leo</span> les invita"},
        "title": "Vengan a conocer el Colegio Los Arces",
        "welcome": "Un colegio pequeño, con patio de árboles.",
        "hasacts": true, "signup": "Apuntarse",
        "acts": [{"name": "Jornada de puertas abiertas", "weekday": "Sábado", "daymonth": "21 de noviembre",
            "hours": "De 10:00 a 13:00", "when": "Sábado, 21 de noviembre, de 10:00 a 13:00",
            "place": "Entrada principal", "url": "/local/oksigeniaeguahe/j.php?t=abc"}],
        "ask": {"text": "O, si les viene mejor, cuéntennos qué buscan y les contestamos.", "button": "Pedir información",
            "url": "/local/oksigeniaeguahe/invita.php?action=pedir"}
    }
}}
<section class="pared compartido-invitacion{{^hasacts}} sin-actos{{/hasacts}}" aria-labelledby="titulo">
    <div class="invitacion-cabeza">
        {{#card}}
        <div class="invitacion-tarjeta grande">
            <span class="invitacion-sello" aria-hidden="true">{{#logo}}<img src="{{logo}}" alt="">{{/logo}}{{^logo}}<span>{{initials}}</span>{{/logo}}</span>
            <p class="invitacion-de">{{{from}}}</p>
            <h1 id="titulo" class="invitacion-titulo" dir="auto">{{title}}</h1>
        </div>
        {{/card}}
        {{#welcome}}<p class="invitacion-bienvenida" dir="auto">{{welcome}}</p>{{/welcome}}
    </div>
    <div class="invitacion-cuerpo">
        {{#hasacts}}
        <ul class="invitacion-actos">
            {{#acts}}
            <li class="invitacion-acto">
                <span class="invitacion-acto-fecha"><span>{{weekday}}</span><b>{{daymonth}}</b></span>
                <span class="invitacion-acto-que"><b dir="auto">{{name}}</b><span>{{hours}}{{#place}} · <span dir="auto">{{place}}</span>{{/place}}</span></span>
                <a class="boton principal" href="{{url}}">{{signup}}</a>
            </li>
            {{/acts}}
        </ul>
        {{/hasacts}}
        {{#ask}}
        <p class="invitacion-pedir"><span>{{text}}</span> <a class="boton secundario" href="{{url}}">{{button}}</a></p>
        {{/ask}}
    </div>
</section>
